    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6t, \u00fea binnan six dagum, \u00fee se so\u00f0a God \u00fea gesceafta gesceop, \u00fee he gescippan wolde, gesceawode \u00d0a \u00feuhte him to huxlic, \u00fe\u00e6t he hiran sceolde \u00e6nigum hlaforde, \u00fea he swa \u00e6nlic w\u00e6s, & nolde wur\u00f0ian He nolde \u00fea habban his Scippend him to hlaforde, ne he nolde \u00feurhwunian on \u00f0\u00e6re so\u00fef\u00e6stnisse \u00f0\u00e6s \u00d0a n\u00e6fde he nan setl, hw\u00e6r he sittan mihte, for \u00f0an \u00f0e nan heofon nolde hine aberan, ne nan rice n\u00e6s, \u00d0a afunde se modiga, hwilce his mihta w\u00e6ron, \u00fea \u00fea his fet ne mihton fur\u00f0on ahwar standan, ac he \u00d0a on \u00f0am sixtan d\u00e6ge, si\u00fe\u00fean \u00f0is gedon w\u00e6s, gesceop se \u00e6lmihtiga God mannan of eor\u00f0an ADAM \u00d0a beswac se deofol si\u00f0\u00f0an eft \u00fea men, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Godes bebod tobr\u00e6con forra\u00fee & wurdon \u00fea deadlice, We nyma\u00f0 of \u00feam bocum \u00feas endebyrdnysse, \u00fee Moises awrat, se m\u00e6ra heretoga, swa swa him God Fif bec he awrat mid wundorlicum dihte. Seo forme ys Genesis, \u00fee befeh\u00f0 \u00feas racu \u00e6rest fram frumsceafte, & be Adames synne & hu he Cain w\u00e6s his sunu, se acwealde his bro\u00f0or, Abel gehaten, unscildigne mannan for his agenum andan, Ac Adam gestrinde \u00e6fter Abeles slege o\u00f0erne sunu, se w\u00e6s Seth gehaten, of \u00f0am strenge com \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t We secga\u00f0 nu",
